new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d384c25
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README-LENDING.md
@@ -0,0 +1,55 @@
+# Lending portal (Apache Fineract + WhatsApp)
+
+A back-office portal for a lender / NBFC on top of [Apache Fineract](https://fineract.apache.org) (Apache-2.0),
+built from the Nuxt UI dashboard template (MIT).
+
+| Page | What it shows |
+|---|---|
+| Portfolio | active loans, outstanding, overdue, portfolio at risk — per currency |
+| Loans | every loan; open one for its repayment schedule and transactions |
+| Collections | overdue loans, largest first, with the collector (loan officer); one click sends WhatsApp reminders |
+| Investors | loans sold to investors (Fineract asset externalization), per investor |
+| Calculators | EMI, flat vs reducing interest, part prepayment, eligibility (FOIR), amortization schedule |
+
+## Configure (`.env`)
+
+```
+FINERACT_URL=https://your-fineract/fineract-provider/api/v1   # default: the public Mifos demo
+FINERACT_TENANT=default
+FINERACT_USER=...
+FINERACT_PASSWORD=...
+WHATSAPP_TOKEN=...              # Meta WhatsApp Business Cloud API token; without it updates are only recorded (dry run)
+WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=...
+WHATSAPP_DEFAULT_CC=91          # added to 10-digit local numbers
+PORTAL_USER=admin               # portal login (HTTP Basic) — set PORTAL_PASSWORD on any shared machine or server
+PORTAL_PASSWORD=...
+WEBHOOK_SECRET=...              # lets Fineract's hook and the reminder job call /api/webhooks/* and /api/notify/* without the login
+```
+
+Investors' and collectors' WhatsApp numbers: `data/contacts.json`. Borrowers' numbers come from Fineract (client mobile).
+
+## WhatsApp updates
+
+WhatsApp only delivers **approved templates** outside a 24-hour chat window. Create these in WhatsApp Manager
+(category: Utility), with the body parameters in this order:
+
+| Template | To | Parameters |
+|---|---|---|
+| `loan_disbursed` | borrower | name, amount, loan account, first instalment |
+| `payment_received` | borrower | name, amount paid, loan account, outstanding |
+| `payment_overdue` | borrower | name, overdue amount, loan account |
+| `collection_update` | collector | collector name, borrower, amount paid, outstanding |
+| `collector_overdue` | collector | collector name, borrower, borrower phone, overdue amount, loan account |
+| `investor_update` | investor | investor name, loan account, event, amount |
+| `loan_status` | borrower | name, loan account, status |
+
+**Events from Fineract:** System → Manage Hooks → add a *Web* hook with payload URL
+`https://<portal>/api/webhooks/fineract?secret=<WEBHOOK_SECRET>`, content type JSON, events *LOAN: DISBURSE, REPAYMENT*.
+
+**Daily overdue reminders:** `POST https://<portal>/api/notify/overdue?secret=<WEBHOOK_SECRET>` once a day
+(stitaP: `/cron add "every day at 10:00" curl -X POST …`).
+
+## Running Fineract yourself
+
+Fineract needs Java 21 and PostgreSQL or MariaDB; the easiest way is the official Docker images
+(see `docker-compose` files in the Fineract repository).
